      "reference_page": "https://www.goethe.de/ins/se/de/m/spr/prf/ueb/pa1.html",
      "section": "Alphabetische Wortliste",
      "note": "The reference page answers HTTP 403 to scripted clients; the official PDF above was downloaded and searched. Page numbers below are PDF page numbers of that file."
    }
